## Original Content
The grocery chain will close several underperforming stores when leases expire.

## Summary
A 91-year-old supermarket chain is closing several underperforming stores and laying off employees. The closures will take effect when the stores' leases expire.

## Key Points
- A supermarket chain operating for 91 years is closing multiple store locations
- The stores slated for closure are underperforming
- Store closures will occur when current leases expire
- The closures will result in employee layoffs


